      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonestown%2C_Texas",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Until the late 1980s, Jonestown had fewer than 1,000 residents, most of whom lived in weekend cabins.",
